/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
.idea/
sample/sample.strata
# Stray test-project scaffold (rescaffolds from the reopen-on-startup set).
themes/themes.strata/
target/

# Machine-local agent workflow: the session context (CLAUDE.local.md), and under .agent/ the
# backlog, the engineering-reference corpus and the design bundles. Deliberately not part of
# the repo — only the run-app and fmt skills are committed, for any contributor's agent to use.
# No trailing slash on .agent: in a worktree it is a symlink to the main checkout, and git
# matches a symlink as a blob, so a directory-only pattern would leave it showing as untracked.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.agent

# A local clone of the Freya fork (the build uses the git dependency; the review
# workflow and local fork development clone here).
/crates/freya/

# **Release signing keys, if one is ever generated in the working tree.** The private half signs
# every release the in-app updater will accept (docs/RELEASING.md), so it must never be committed —
# and `minisign -G` writes into the current directory, which is how it ends up here in the first
# place. A backstop, not a place to keep them: the key belongs somewhere outside this checkout.
# The public half is not secret but has no business here either, since it lives in the source as
# `strata_core::update::MINISIGN_PUBLIC_KEY`.
*.key
strata.pub
